{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/a/2daa1960638ffe458aed97417e8c68af8cdba825.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) =\\int_{0}^{x^{2}} e^{-t} \\, dt$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"141\" height=\"48\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/a/bbad379658bd32e9b6479bbd666b93a96e6b48ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f&#39;(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/8/c488d1075cb86a3b1a05cdc0deaa2037d8e240cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -2xe^{-x^{2}}  \\quad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2xe^{-x^{2}}  \\quad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2e^{-x^{2}}  \\quad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\ e^{-x^{2}}  \\quad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\ 2xe^{x^{2}}  \\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"504\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/c/d5cfc7676f1697ca54e1e8e32bccc56e2eccd00a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\int_{0}^{x^{2}} e^{-t} \\, dt = \\left. -e^{-t} \\right|_{0}^{x^{2}} = 1 - e^{-x^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"316\" height=\"48\" />. The derivative of this is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/3/273f2023441de53f40f1b1d8e14ed82ab29df921.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 2xe^{-x^{2}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"101\" height=\"35\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest\">2025 TMTA Calculus</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Prob